OL,3,GNEWSACider makers fear future for
OL,4,Aorchards as costs grow
OL,5,
OL,6,FRising costs could force the cider
OL,7,Findustry to reduce their reliance on
OL,8,FBritish-grown apples, according to
OL,9,Fseveral well-established businesses.
OL,11,FHigher alcohol duty, energy bills and
OL,12,Fpackaging costs are making it harder to
OL,13,Fstay profitable, according to a
OL,14,Fproducer in Somerset.
OL,16,FThe government said it was supporting
OL,17,Fthe sector by increasing the value of
OL,18,FSmall Producer Relief, which provides
OL,19,Flower alcohol duty rates for some
OL,20,Fsmaller and medium-sized producers.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
