OL,3,GNEWSACider makers fear future for
OL,4,Aorchards as costs grow
OL,5,
OL,6,FMatilda Temperley, director of Burrow
OL,7,FHill farm near Martock, said it would
OL,8,Fbe a "tragedy" to stop using its own
OL,9,Fapples due to climbing costs.
